{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810101-line","text":"现在是黄昏时分，你站在热浪里。矿地令你一阵晕眩，矿脉烧得像融化的黄油。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810102-line","text":"「伟大的存护星神克里珀…祂能听到我们的声音。」矿工们举起铁锹又落下，他们像狂热动物，又像信徒。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810103-line","text":"有人看到了你——戴着探测灯的*头号矿工*。他的臂膀黝黑健壮，嘴唇同样乌黑。他豪迈的笑容令人难忘。他镶了一颗金牙，在你脑海中不停放大、扭曲，最后你只看得到他的*笑容*——嘴唇和眼睛搅在一起，像调色盘里颜料融化。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810104-line","text":"「琥珀王的恩赐，『克里珀』存护这片地脉。你可以挑一个带走。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-7539100505255928878-choice","text":"献给琥珀王。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-5276501885006340340-effect","text":"获得1个强化过的2星「存护」祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-15583553451517555728-choice","text":"和*头号矿工*打一架，把好东西抢过来！","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-11651143010812831740-effect","text":"进行一场战斗，获得2个随机「毁灭」祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-1838324248690805109-choice","text":"克里珀的恩赐。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-14908890443191926827-effect","text":"强化2个随机祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-3303085497400791443-choice","text":"克里珀的祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-4537004981039454590-effect","text":"获得1个2星「存护」的祝福。","speaker":""}]}
